hadiths[67]{hadithnumber,text}:
"471","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Fitr us din hai jis din tum iftar karo, aur Azha us din hai jis din tum qurbani karo.'"
"472","[AI-translation] Yazeed bin Abi Ubaid Maula Salamah bin Akwa' se, Salamah bin Akwa' se riwayat hai ke woh Eid ke din ghusl karte."
"473","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har Eid mein Habarah ki chadar pahante."
"474","[AI-translation] Muttalib bin Abdullah bin Hantab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eid ke din subah namazgah badi sadak se tashreef le jate. Phir jab wapas tashreef laate to doosri sadak se Ammar bin Yasir ke ghar par se wapas tashreef laate."
"475","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Abdur Rahman Taimi se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Eid ke din namazgah se wapas aate dekha aur woh bazar ke neeche se Tammareen par se guzre. Yahan tak ke jab woh A'raj masjid ke paas jo bazar ke talab ke maqam par hai pahunche to khade hue aur Fajj Aslam ki taraf munh karke dua ki phir tashreef le gae."
"476","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke jab woh Eid ke din subah namazgah ki taraf nikalte to takbeer kahte aur apni awaz takbeer se buland karte."
"477","[AI-translation] Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke woh Eidul Fitr ke din jab suraj tulu ho jata to subah namazgah ki taraf nikalte. Phir namazgah mein takbeer kahte yahan tak ke jab imam baithta to takbeer chhod dete."
"478","[AI-translation] Abul Huwairis se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Amr bin Hazm ko jo Najran mein the likha: 'Qurbaniyon mein jaldi karo aur Fitri mein takheer karo, aur logon ko naseehat karo.'"
"479","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Sulaim se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eidul Fitr ke din maidan ki taraf nikalne se pahle khate aur is ka hukm dete."
"480","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Jubair se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne donon Eidain ki namaz namazgah mein padhi aur is se pahle aur baad mein kuch na padha. Phir aurton ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur unhen khade ho kar khutba diya, aur sadqa ka hukm diya. Unhon ne kaha: To aurten bali aur is jaise se sadqa karne lagin."
"481","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke woh Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Eid ke din subah namazgah ki taraf gae phir apne ghar wapas aae aur Eid se pahle aur baad mein namaz na padhi."
"482","[AI-translation] Abdul Malik bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke Ka'b bin Ujrah Eid se pahle aur baad mein namaz na padhte."
"483","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Ali bin Hanafiyah se, apne walid (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein Eidul Fitr aur Eidul Azha ke din masjid mein namaz na padhte yahan tak ke namazgah aate. Aur jab wapas aate to masjid se guzarte aur us mein namaz padhte."
"484","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke woh Eidul Fitr ke din namaz se pahle aur baad mein namaz na padhte."
"485","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar Eidain aur Istisqa mein saat aur paanch takbeeren kahte, aur khutbe se pahle namaz padhte, aur qiraat buland karte."
"486","[AI-translation] Ja'far bin Muhammad se, apne walid se, Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Eidain aur Istisqa mein saat aur paanch takbeeren kahin aur qiraat buland ki."
"487","[AI-translation] Usman bin Urwah se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke Abu Ayyub aur Zaid bin Sabit ne Marwan ko hukm diya ke woh Eidain ki namaz mein saat aur paanch takbeeren kahe."
"488","[AI-translation] Nafi' Maula Ibn Umar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abu Hurairah ke sath Azha aur Fitr mein hazri di. To unhon ne pahli rak'at mein qiraat se pahle saat takbeeren kahin, aur aakhri mein qiraat se pahle paanch takbeeren kahin."
"489","[AI-translation] Iyadh bin Abdullah bin Sa'd bin Abi Sarh se, Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eidul Fitr aur Eidul Azha ki namaz khutbe se pahle padhte."
"490","[AI-translation] Ata bin Rabah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ibn Abbas ko kahte suna: Main Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par gawahi deta hun ke Aap ne Eid ke din khutbe se pahle namaz padhi, phir khutba diya aur samjha ke unhon ne aurton ko nahin sunaya. To Aap in ke paas aae aur unhen yaad dilaaya aur naseehat ki, aur unhen sadqa ka hukm diya. Aur Aap ke sath Bilal apna kapda is tarah phailae hue the. To aurat bali aur cheez phenkne lagi."
"491","[AI-translation] Salim bin Abdullah se, Ibn Umar se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr aur Umar Eidain ki namaz khutbe se pahle padhte."
"492","[AI-translation] Umar bin Nafi' se, apne walid se, Ibn Umar se, Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman se isi ki misl riwayat hai."
"493","[AI-translation] Hisham bin Hassan se, Ibn Sirin se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Eidul Fitr aur Nahr ke din namaz se farigh hone ke baad apni sawari par khutba dete."
"494","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Yazeed Khatmi se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam), Abu Bakr, Umar aur Usman khutbe se pahle namaz se aaghaz karte yahan tak ke Mu'awiyah aaya. To Mu'awiyah ne khutbe ko muqaddam kiya."
"495","[AI-translation] Iyadh bin Abdullah bin Sa'd bin Abi Sarh se riwayat hai ke Abu Sa'id Khudri (Raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Marwan ne mujhe aur ek aadmi ko jise us ne naam lekar pukara bheja. Phir woh hamen lekar chala yahan tak ke namazgah aaya. Phir woh chadhne laga to main ne use apni taraf khaincha. To us ne kaha: Aey Abu Sa'id! Jo tum jante ho woh chhod diya gaya. To Abu Sa'id ne kaha: Phir main teen martaba cheekha aur kaha: Allah ki qasam! Tum is se buri cheez hi ki taraf aaoge."
"496","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Waqid Laisi se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Azha aur Fitr mein kya padhte the? To unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Qaf aur Quran Majeed, aur Iqtarabatissa'atu Wanshaqqal Qamar padhte the."
"497","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Khattab (Raziyallahu anhu) ne Abu Waqid Laisi se poocha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) Azha aur Fitr ki namaz mein kya padha karte the? To unhon ne kaha: Woh Qaf aur Quran Majeed, aur Iqtarabatissa'ah padhte the."
"498","[AI-translation] Lais se, Ata se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab khutba dete to apne asa par tek lagate."
"499","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Sunnat yeh hai ke imam Eidain mein do khutbe de aur donon ke darmiyan baith kar fasl kare."
"500","[AI-translation] Umar bin Abdul Aziz se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein do Eiden jama huin. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Aaliyah walon mein se jo baithna chahe to baghair harj ke baithe.'"
"501","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid Maula Ibn Azhar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Usman bin Affan (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazri di. Phir woh aae aur namaz padhi phir gae aur khutba diya. Phir unhon ne kaha: Beshak tumhare liye aaj ke din mein do Eiden jama ho gai hain. Jo Aaliyah walon mein se Juma ka intezar karna chahe to woh is ka intezar kare, aur jo wapas jana chahe to woh wapas jae, beshak main ne use ijazat de di hai."
"502","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid Maula Ibn Azhar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Ali ke sath Eid mein hazri di, jabke Usman ghere hue the."
"503","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se, Umm Salamah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Jab ashra dakhil ho aur tum mein se koi qurbani ka irada kare to woh apne baal aur khaal mein se kuch na kaate.'"
"504","[AI-translation] Abdul Aziz bin Suhaib se, Anas se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne do safed siyah mendhon ki qurbani ki."
"505","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah mein qurbani ki: Oont saat aadmiyon ki taraf se, aur gae saat aadmiyon ki taraf se."
"506","[AI-translation] Jabir se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke sath Hudaibiyah wale saal mein qurbani ki: Oont saat aadmiyon ki taraf se, aur gae saat aadmiyon ki taraf se."
"507","[AI-translation] Ali se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Tum mein se koi apni qurbani ka gosht teen din ke baad na khae.'"
"508","[AI-translation] Abu Ubaid Maula Ibn Azhar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Ali bin Abi Talib (Raziyallahu anhu) ke sath Eid mein hazir tha aur unhen kahte suna: Tum mein se koi apni qurbani ka gosht teen din ke baad na khae."
"509","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Waqid bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke gosht ko teen din ke baad khane se mana farmaya. Abdullah bin Abi Bakr ne kaha: Phir main ne is ka zikr Amrah se kiya. To unhon ne kaha: Sach kaha, main ne Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein qurbani ke mauqe par dehat ke kuch log aae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Teen din ke liye zakheera karo aur baqi sadqa kar do.' Unhon ne kaha: Is ke baad kaha gaya: Ya Rasulullah! Log apni qurbaniyon se faida uthate the: Is ki charbi pighlate aur is ki khaal se mashkeeze banate. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Is mein kya hai?' Ya jaisa Aap ne farmaya. Unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Qurbani ke gosht ko teen din ke baad khane se mana kiya gaya tha. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Main ne tumhen is wajah se mana kiya tha ke qurbani ke mauqe par bahar se aane wale aae the. To khao, zakheera karo aur sadqa karo.'"
"510","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne qurbani ke gosht ko teen din ke baad khane se mana farmaya, phir baad mein farmaya: 'Khao, tosha banao aur zakheera karo.'"
"511","[AI-translation] Ibrahim bin Maisarah se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) ko kahte suna: Ham Allah ke hukm se apni qurbaniyon mein se jitna chahte zibah karte, phir is ke baqi se Basrah tak ka tosha lete."
"512","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim se, apne chacha Abdullah bin Zaid Mazini se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namazgah ki taraf istisqa ke liye nikle. To Aap ne qibla ki taraf munh kiya, apni chadar ko palta, aur do rak'aten padhin."
"513","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne namazgah mein istisqa kiya aur do rak'aten padhin."
"514","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Zaid Mazini ko kahte suna: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) namazgah ki taraf nikle aur istisqa kiya. To Aap ne jab qibla ki taraf munh kiya to apni chadar ko palta."
"515","[AI-translation] Abbad bin Tamim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne istisqa kiya jabke Aap par Aap ki kali chadar thi. To Aap ne irada kiya ke is ke neeche se pakad kar use upar kar den. Jab woh Aap par bhari hui to use kandhe par palat diya."
"516","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se, Hazrat Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke zamane mein logon par sakht qahat pada. Phir ek Yahudi guzra aur kaha: Allah ki qasam! Agar tumhara sathi chahe to tum par jitni chaho barish ho, lekin woh is ko pasand nahin karta. To Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko Yahudi ki baat ki khabar di gai. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya us ne yeh kaha?' Unhon ne kaha: Han. Aap ne farmaya: 'Main Najd walon par qahat ke zariye madad mangta hun. Aur main badal ko darar se nikalte dekhta hun aur main use napasand karta hun. Tumhara wa'da falan din hai, main tumhare liye istisqa karunga.' Unhon ne kaha: Jab woh din aaya to log subah gae aur juda na hue yahan tak ke un par jitni unhon ne chahi barish hui. Unhon ne kaha: Aasman ek hafta na ruka."
"517","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Maweshi halak ho gae aur raste kat gae, to Allah se dua karen. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne dua ki aur ham par Juma se Juma tak barish hui. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ek aadmi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Ghar gir gae, raste kat gae, aur maweshi halak ho gae. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) khade hue aur farmaya: 'Aey Allah! Pahadon ki chotiyon, teelon, wadiyon ke pet aur darakhton ke ugne ki jagahon par barish barsa.' To Madinah se badal is tarah hat gae jaise kapda phat jata hai."
"518","[AI-translation] Muttalib bin Hantab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) barish ke waqt dua farmate: 'Aey Allah! Rahmat ki barish barsa, azab, bala, girane wali aur dubone wali barish na barsa. Aey Allah! Pahadiyon aur darakhton ke ugne ki jagahon par barsa. Aey Allah! Hamare ird gird barsa aur ham par na barsa.'"
"519","[AI-translation] Aishah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab aasman mein naya badal dekhte, yani badal, to apna kaam chhod dete, qibla ki taraf munh karte, aur farmate: 'Aey Allah! Main Teri panah mangta hun is ke shar se jo is mein hai.' Phir agar Allah use hata deta to Allah ki hamd karte, aur agar barish hoti to farmate: 'Aey Allah! Nafa bakhsh barish ata farma.'"
"520","[AI-translation] Muttalib bin Hantab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab aasman mein bijli chamakti ya garaj hoti to is ka asar Aap ke chehre par nazar aata. Phir jab barish hoti to woh asar door ho jata."
"521","[AI-translation] Urwah bin Zubair se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab tum mein se koi bijli ya barish dekhe to is ki taraf ishara na kare, lekin is ka wasf bayan kare."
"522","[AI-translation] Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah bin Mas'ud se, Zaid bin Khalid Juhani se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hamen Hudaibiyah mein raat ki barish ke baad subah ki namaz padhai. Jab farigh hue to logon ki taraf mutawajjeh hue aur farmaya: 'Kya tum jante ho ke tumhare Rab ne kya farmaya?' Unhon ne kaha: Allah aur Us ke Rasool zyada behtar jante hain. Aap ne farmaya: Mere bandon mein se koi subah mujh par iman lane wala hua aur koi kufr karne wala. Jo kahta hai: Ham par Allah ke fazl aur Us ki rahmat se barish hui, woh mujh par iman lane wala hai aur sitare ka munkir hai. Aur jo kahta hai: Ham par falan ya falan sitare se barish hui, woh mera munkir hai aur sitare par iman lane wala hai."
"523","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Abi Bakr se, apne walid se riwayat hai ke logon par ek raat barish hui. Jab Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne subah ki to in ke paas tashreef lae aur farmaya: 'Zameen ka koi tukda nahin magar is raat barish hui hai.'"
"524","[AI-translation] Muttalib bin Hantab se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Raat din ki koi ghadi nahin magar aasman mein barish hoti hai, Allah use jahan chahta phair deta hai.'"
"525","[AI-translation] Qais bin Sakan se, Abdullah bin Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Beshak Allah hawaon ko bhejta hai to woh aasman se pani uthati hain. Phir badal mein se guzarti hain yahan tak ke doodh wali oontni ki tarah bhar jatin, phir barish barsatin."
"526","[AI-translation] Suahil bin Abi Salih se, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qareeb hai ke Madinah mein aisi barish ho ke inhen ghar na bachayen aur unhen baalon ke saiban ke siwa kuch na bachae.'"
"527","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Sulaim se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Madinah walon par aisi barish hogi jo inhen mitti ke gharon mein na bachae gi.'"
"528","[AI-translation] Yusuf bin Abdullah bin Salam se, apne walid se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Qareeb hai ke Madinah mein chalis raaton tak barish ho jo inhen mitti ke gharon mein na bachae."
"529","[AI-translation] Salih bin Abdullah bin Zubair se riwayat hai ke Ka'b ne un se kaha jabke woh Makkah mein mitti ka band bana rahe the: Use mazboot karo aur pakka karo, kyunke ham kitabon mein pate hain ke aakhri zamane mein sailab bade ho jaenge."
"530","[AI-translation] Sa'id bin Musayyab se, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Makkah mein ek martaba aisa sailab aaya jo donon pahadon ke darmiyan bhar gaya."
"531","[AI-translation] Suahil bin Abi Salih se, apne walid se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Qahat yeh nahin ke tum par barish na ho, lekin qahat yeh hai ke tum par barish ho, phir barish ho, aur zameen kuch na ugae.'"
"532","[AI-translation] Yazeed ya Naufal bin Abdullah Hashimi se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Mujhe sab se kam barish wali zameen mein thahraya gaya hai, aur woh aasman ki do aankhon ke darmiyan hai: Sham ki aankh aur Yaman ki aankh.'"
"533","[AI-translation] Aswad se, Ibn Mas'ud (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Madinah aasman ki do aankhon ke darmiyan hai: ek aankh Sham mein aur ek Yaman mein. Aur woh sab se kam barish wali zameen hai.'"
"534","[AI-translation] Muhammad bin Amr se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Meri Saba hawa se madad ki gai aur woh mujh se pahle logon par azab thi.'"
"535","[AI-translation] Safwan bin Sulaim se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Hawa ko bura na kaho aur Allah se is ke shar ki panah mango.'"
"536","[AI-translation] Tsabit bin Qais se, Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Logon ko Makkah ke raste mein hawa ne pakad liya jabke Umar hajj kar rahe the. Phir woh taiz ho gai to Umar ne apne ird gird walon se kaha: Tumhen hawa ke bare mein kya pahuncha hai? To unhon ne use kuch jawab na diya. To mujhe woh pahunchi jo Umar ne hawa ke bare mein poochi thi, to main ne apni sawari taiz ki yahan tak ke Umar ko pa liya, jabke main logon ke peeche tha. To main ne kaha: Aey Ameerul Momineen! Mujhe khabar di gai ke Aap ne hawa ke bare mein poocha hai. Beshak main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: 'Hawa Allah ki rahmat se hai, rahmat aur azab ke sath aati hai. To use bura na kaho aur Allah se is ki bhalai mango, aur Allah se is ke shar ki panah mango.'"
"537","[AI-translation] Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab bhi hawa chalti to Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ghutnon ke bal baith jate aur farmate: 'Aey Allah! Ise rahmat bana aur ise azab na bana. Aey Allah! Ise hawaen bana aur ise hawa na bana.' Ibn Abbas ne Allah Ta'ala ki Kitab ke bare mein kaha: Ham ne in par taiz hawa bheji [Qamar: 19], aur ham ne in par banjh hawa bheji [Zariyat: 41]. Unhon ne kaha: Aur ham ne boojhal hawaen bhejin [Hijr: 22], aur woh khushkhabri dene wali hawaen bhejta hai [Room: 46]."
